165
00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:45.110
Tuuliku tiibade laginas.

166
00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:48.290
Maas palvetab tuline rukis.

167
00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.840
Kummargil päi.

168
00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:54.020
Mu ema kollast kampsunit

169
00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.030
Olen kohe kera rüpes.

170
00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.355
Veeren ära.

171
00:12:03.559 --> 00:12:07.090
Ikka vahest tuleb mul isegi meelde.

172
00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:11.870
August Sanga päris noorena öeldud
read, kus ta ohkab, et nii puud

173
